<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: royal target -->
  <OE_RoyalTarget.label>皇家目标</OE_RoyalTarget.label>
  <!-- EN: This ability places a lasting mark on the target, designating them as prey for the nobility of Obsidia Empire. The marked target suffers mental weakening, takes increased damage, and experiences a reduction in movement speed, making escape nearly impossible. -->
  <OE_RoyalTarget.description>此能力在目标身上放置持久标记，将其指定为黑曜石帝国贵族的猎物。被标记的目标会遭受精神削弱，承受更多伤害，并且移动速度降低，几乎无法逃脱。</OE_RoyalTarget.description>
  
</LanguageData>